  "slug": "brown-rice-pudding-with-peaches",
  "name": "Brown Rice Pudding with Peaches",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "Brown rice is perfectly sweetened with brown sugar and peaches to make a great alternative for traditional rice pudding. Add nuts for some crunch.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Stir peaches, rice, 1/4 cup water, brown sugar, and vanilla extract together in a saucepan over low heat. Simmer until peaches start to wilt, 3 to 5 minutes. Stir in butter. Sprinkle with cinnamon and nutmeg after plating."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 4,
